==Battleground==
*2 [[Doge]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*1 [[Those Guys]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 90% HP:
**1 [[Pokota (Enemy)|Pokota]] spawns as the boss.
**3 [[Snache]]s spawn, delay 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

